  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "At Yu Tian heroes assembly, Hei Lou Lan of Hei tribe stands opposite Liu Wen Wu of Liu tribe. The bloodlines Giant Sun Immortal Venerable passed on are collectively called the Huang Jin family, and that family holds supreme authority in Northern Plains.",
      "chapters": [
        497
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_yu_tian",
        "char_hei_lou_lan",
        "fac_hei_tribe",
        "char_liu_wen_wu",
        "fac_liu_tribe",
        "fac_huang_jin_bloodline",
        "reg_northern_plains"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan arrives with Ge tribe and a huge wolf army. Hei Lou Lan greets Wolf King Chang Shan Yin, accepts the proposed team-up for revenge and the contest, and gifts a rank five turtle jade wolf skin Gu. Undecided large tribes then side with Hei Lou Lan.",
      "chapters": [
        499
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "alliance-at-yu-tian",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "fac_ge_tribe",
        "char_chang_shan_yin"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A later chapter titles a war of five hundred thousand wolves.",
      "chapters": [
        501
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "alliance-at-yu-tian",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Speaking with Hei Bai, Dong Fang Chang Fan says they are all descendants of Ancestor Giant Sun, and that when Giant Sun set up the Imperial Court one motive was to weaken other tribes and preserve that bloodline.",
      "chapters": [
        519
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "alliance-at-yu-tian",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_hei_bai",
        "char_dong_fang_chang_fan",
        "char_immortal_zombie_giant_sun",
        "loc_imperial_court"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Ma tribe and Song tribe fight at Mirror Lake while the ten year blizzard’s aura builds over Northern Plains, and Tai Bai Yun Sheng enters the contest by name.",
      "chapters": [
        523
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "mirror-lake-and-the-blizzard-aura",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_ma_tribe",
        "fac_song_tribe",
        "loc_mirror_lake",
        "reg_northern_plains",
        "char_tai_bai_yun_sheng"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Inside Imperial Court blessed land, consecutive chapter titles name Giant Sun Immortal Venerable and the Imperial Court Sacred Palace.",
      "chapters": [
        552
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "imperial-court-blessed-land",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_imperial_court_blessed_land",
        "char_giant_sun_immortal_venerable",
        "loc_northern_plains_sacred_palace"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At the geographic peak of the sacred palace’s eighth level the site is empty; Eighty-Eight True Yang Building appears there only when the ten year blizzard strikes.",
      "chapters": [
        553
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "imperial-court-blessed-land",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_eighty_eight_true_yang_building"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Supreme True Inheritance is named as a higher tier above ordinary and unparalleled true inheritances in that building’s inheritance domain.",
      "chapters": [
        600
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "imperial-court-blessed-land",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_true_inheritance_grades"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Late chapters stage Fang Yuan against Giant Sun’s will.",
      "chapters": [
        640
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "imperial-court-blessed-land",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Ma Hong Yun appears in person at a banquet Chang Biao holds for Chang Li.",
      "chapters": [
        578
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "ma-hong-yun-at-the-banquet",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_ma_hong_yun",
        "char_chang_biao",
        "char_chang_li"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Chapter 649 is titled Twin Demons. Fang Yuan and Hei Lou Lan cooperate against that will; Giant Sun’s will names Hei Lou Lan a Huang Jin bloodline descendant who colluded with an outsider, Fixed Immortal Travel is contested between the two, and rank nine wisdom Gu comes to Fang Yuan.",
      "chapters": [
        649
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "contest-close",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_gao_yang",
        "gu_fixed_immortal_travel",
        "gu_wisdom_gu"
      ]
    }
  ],
